edk2-ovmf-nightly-bins
======================

This repository uses GitHub workflows to build nightly images of EDK2 OVMF
firmware for QEMU.

See Releases.

The ovmf-*-secboot.fd images are built with Secure Boot and TPM 2.0
support. The x86 ones (x86_64 and ia32) also require SMM, so QEMU must be
started with
"-machine q35,smm=on -global driver=cfi.pflash01,property=secure,value=on".
